      "html": "<body>\r\n<cb:mulu level=\"1\" n=\"7\" type=\"會\">7 被甲莊嚴會</cb:mulu><cb:mulu level=\"2\">1</cb:mulu><cb:div type=\"hui\">\r\n<milestone n=\"22\" unit=\"juan\"/>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0120b17\">0120b17</span>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0120b18\">0120b18</span>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0120b19\">0120b19</span><cb:juan n=\"022\" fun=\"open\"><cb:mulu n=\"022\" type=\"卷\"></cb:mulu><cb:mulu level=\"2\">2</cb:mulu><cb:jhead><title>大寶積經</title>卷第二十二</cb:jhead>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0120b20\">0120b20</span>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0120b21\">0120b21</span><byline cb:type=\"Translator\"><anchor xml:id=\"fxT11p0120b01\"/>大唐三藏菩提流志奉　詔譯</byline>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0120b22\">0120b22</span><cb:jhead>被甲莊嚴會第七之二</cb:jhead></cb:juan>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0120b23\">0120b23</span><p>「復次無邊慧！我念往昔修菩薩行時被如是\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0120b24\">0120b24</span>甲冑、乘如是大乘，超過諸際，能滅黑闇，能除\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0120b25\">0120b25</span>怖畏，以大精進，乃於無量百千俱胝那由他\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0120b26\">0120b26</span>佛所聞此菩薩摩訶薩甲冑莊嚴大乘莊嚴。\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0120b27\">0120b27</span>踊躍歡喜觀此法時，於佛世尊恭敬尊重，不\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0120b28\">0120b28</span>作是念：『我被如是甲冑，我有如是甲冑，我得\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0120b29\">0120b29</span>如是法，我有如是法，我有如是種類之法。』我\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0120c01\">0120c01</span>於<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0120003\">爾＝是【明】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0120003\">爾【大】，是【明】</span><app n=\"0120003\"><p class=\"lg\">爾</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【明】\">是</rdg></app>時無有我想，遠離身見、遠離我慢，心\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0120c02\">0120c02</span>無高下亦無分別，為欲攝受一切眾生，護持\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0120c03\">0120c03</span>諸佛如來法藏，成熟無量百千俱胝那由他\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0120c04\">0120c04</span>眾生，曾無一念勞倦之心。我於爾時不捨甲\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0120c05\">0120c05</span>冑乘無邊乘，世世生中能破魔軍，魔諸眷屬\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0120c06\">0120c06</span>退敗消滅，魔之使者怖畏馳散，一切異道——諸\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0120c07\">0120c07</span>遮羅迦、路伽耶陀、波利婆羅遮伽，及此外道\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0120c08\">0120c08</span>相應之輩，我皆降伏為作安隱，一切異論悉\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0120c09\">0120c09</span>已摧殄，一切外道悉已降伏，邪趣眾生令於\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0120c10\">0120c10</span>此乘住眾善軛。為諸眾生開示甲冑甲冑莊\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0120c11\">0120c11</span>嚴，亦為眾生演說如是種類之法安樂大乘，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0120c12\">0120c12</span>住此乘者便獲一切安樂資具，所謂有為安\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0120c13\">0120c13</span>樂資具、轉輪聖王安樂資具、帝釋梵王安樂\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0120c14\">0120c14</span>資具，及得無為安樂資具。為諸眾生說此法\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0120c15\">0120c15</span>時，令諸眾生入此法中生聖種性，建大法幢、\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0120c16\">0120c16</span>作師子吼，而發趣於阿耨多羅三藐三菩提。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0120c17\">0120c17</span><p>「無邊慧！諸菩薩摩訶薩應被如是大甲冑已，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0120c18\">0120c18</span>如理觀察而選擇之，當於何法而發趣之？於\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0120c19\">0120c19</span>一切法盡能知見，無有分別。何以故？諸菩薩\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0120c20\">0120c20</span>摩訶薩安住正道，如理知故；正道發趣，如理\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0120c21\">0120c21</span>見故。如理清淨則不分別非不分別，而於分\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0120c22\">0120c22</span>別不分別中平等知見。若見有法可求可覓\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0120c23\">0120c23</span>則不平等，不住如理清淨知見。以無分別無\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0120c24\">0120c24</span>不分別，於彼分別不分別中而無執取；以無\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0120c25\">0120c25</span>執取，遠離分別及不分別。於此道中無有憐\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0120c26\">0120c26</span>愍、無有施為，亦無增益、亦無取捨。住平正道\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0120c27\">0120c27</span>亦不分別過現未來，遍能了知一切分別。所\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0120c28\">0120c28</span>有隨眠，於一切法得住平等、無顛倒義，乃得\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0120c29\">0120c29</span>名為住斯道者。</p><p>「無邊慧！何等為道及道清淨？\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0121a01\">0121a01</span>所謂說名八支聖道：正見、正思惟、正語、正\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0121a02\">0121a02</span>業、正命、正精進、正念、正定。正見能斷薩迦\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0121a03\">0121a03</span>耶見，超過一切見所行境，一切諸見於一切處\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0121a04\">0121a04</span>悉得清淨，而能了知一切分別，若勝分別、若\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0121a05\">0121a05</span>遍分別，則無分別，無勝分別、無遍分別。不住\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0121a06\">0121a06</span>邪思、斷邪思惟，能見正命、見正命想，見命清\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0121a07\">0121a07</span>淨，住清淨命。如理能見清淨身業、清淨語業、\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0121a08\">0121a08</span>清淨意業。住於正業，正見語業，於語<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0121001\">語＝業【明】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0121001\">語【大】，業【明】</span><app n=\"0121001\"><p class=\"lg\">語</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【明】\">業</rdg></app>者\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0121a09\">0121a09</span>悉能見知，住於正語能淨對治。正精進見善\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0121a10\">0121a10</span>攝精進，住正精進，正見憶念而無有念，亦無\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0121a11\">0121a11</span>作意、無所執取。以清淨念住於正念正見三\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0121a12\">0121a12</span>昧，於三昧中無所依止，而能清淨三昧之見\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0121a13\">0121a13</span>住於正定。無邊慧！諸菩薩摩訶薩如是見時，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0121a14\">0121a14</span>得一切處清淨正見住清淨道。此清淨道為\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0121a15\">0121a15</span>善丈夫之所修行，智者尊重、眾聖悅可、如來\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0121a16\">0121a16</span>稱讚，非一切魔魔民、魔使、魔天、大眾之所行\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0121a17\">0121a17</span>處，亦非一切愛著外道、依止諍論、行見稠林、\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0121a18\">0121a18</span>趣諸非道路伽耶等之所行處，亦非一切愛\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0121a19\">0121a19</span>涅槃者之所行處。何以故？住無為者則於涅\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0121a20\">0121a20</span>槃有所分別，涅槃分別則諸行分別。何以故？\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0121a21\">0121a21</span>涅槃界中超過一切動念分別，尚無無為，況\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0121a22\">0121a22</span>有有為？此道能淨一切分別，乃無少有無為\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0121a23\">0121a23</span>分別，寧有一切有為分別？若於聖道有分別\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0121a24\">0121a24</span>者，則不名為住於聖道。若斷一切動念分別，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0121a25\">0121a25</span>是則名為住於聖道、住無畏道、住安隱道、住\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0121a26\">0121a26</span>安樂道。此道能至無老病死憂苦之處，此道\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0121a27\">0121a27</span>能至無有自性超過性處，此道能至遠離一\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0121a28\">0121a28</span>切性非性處，此道能至無示現相非色相處，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0121a29\">0121a29</span>此道如空遍一切處能至無上大宮殿中。如\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0121b01\">0121b01</span>是去者不復退還，便獲若干安隱快樂。彼大\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0121b02\">0121b02</span>宮殿不可示現，無諸事相、無少有為、無少無\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0121b03\">0121b03</span>為，已滅有為已捨無為，不與眾生有為安樂\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0121b04\">0121b04</span>無為安樂。</p><p>「無邊慧！諸有欣樂有為涅槃，彼尚\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0121b05\">0121b05</span>不求有為安樂，況有能於大宮殿者？大宮殿\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0121b06\">0121b06</span>中無有施設，清涼寂靜故名涅槃，滅貪瞋癡、\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0121b07\">0121b07</span>斷諸隨眠、裂愛見網、竭無明流、拔眾毒箭、盡\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0121b08\">0121b08</span>不善法，故名涅槃。遠離一切憍慢<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0121002\">病疾＝疾病【元】【明】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0121002\">病疾【大】，疾病【元】【明】</span><app n=\"0121002\"><p class=\"lg\">病疾</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【元】 【明】\">疾病</rdg></app>、眾苦\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0121b09\">0121b09</span>逼惱，故名涅槃。非心意識心所所行，故名涅\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0121b10\">0121b10</span>槃。息諸諍論一切結使乃至法想，故名涅\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0121b11\">0121b11</span>槃。絕諸意樂意樂所求，亦無分別所分別相，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0121b12\">0121b12</span>故名涅槃。無邊慧！是為大般涅槃體性。涅槃\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0121b13\">0121b13</span>無邊不可宣說，若有所趣則非是道，道亦無\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0121b14\">0121b14</span>言不可宣說。諸菩薩摩訶薩若以此道趣\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0121b15\">0121b15</span>於涅槃大宮殿時，亦令無量百千眾生住於\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0121b16\">0121b16</span>斯道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0121b17\">0121b17</span><p>「無邊慧！諸菩薩摩訶薩於此道中而發趣時，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0121b18\">0121b18</span>無有勞倦亦無憂惱，隨欲所求、隨欲莊嚴，隨\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0121b19\">0121b19</span>莊嚴處一一莊嚴，隨攝眾生而為說法，令諸\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0121b20\">0121b20</span>眾生皆得歡喜。何以故？此道無等、能淨對治、\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0121b21\">0121b21</span>所作究竟。諸佛世尊、聲聞緣覺，皆於此道而\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0121b22\">0121b22</span>發趣之不相違背，未到彼地，未如其願終不\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0121b23\">0121b23</span>相離。何者為地？謂涅槃地、大宮殿地。譬如虛\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0121b24\">0121b24</span>空不可為喻，唯除虛空以喻虛空。廣大空寂\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0121b25\">0121b25</span>名曰虛空，涅槃宮殿亦復如是，為大空寂，無\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0121b26\">0121b26</span>有主宰亦無我所，一切眾生設入其中，無能\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0121b27\">0121b27</span>攝取一毛端量。廣大空寂廣大無量名大涅\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0121b28\">0121b28</span>槃、名大宮殿。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0121b29\">0121b29</span><p>「無邊慧！諸菩薩摩訶薩此殊勝道，非諸聲聞\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0121c01\">0121c01</span>緣覺所有。住此道者成就一切功德資糧得\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0121c02\">0121c02</span>不退轉，為諸眾生作大饒益，以殊勝行為大\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0121c03\">0121c03</span>莊嚴，以是道故而發趣之。如彼莊嚴，亦非聲\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0121c04\">0121c04</span>聞緣覺所有。諸菩薩摩訶薩住此道時，若作\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0121c05\">0121c05</span>輪王無所顧悋，有大威德神通變現，而能了\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0121c06\">0121c06</span>知世出世間。若作帝釋、大梵天王，無所耽著\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0121c07\">0121c07</span>遠離憍慢，樂見諸佛樂聞正法，成熟無量百\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0121c08\">0121c08</span>千諸天，趣於阿耨多羅三藐三菩提。」</p><p>爾時世\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0121c09\">0121c09</span>尊而說偈言：</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0121c10\">0121c10</span><p class=\"lg\"><p class=\"lg\">「菩薩殊勝道，<caesura/>世間無有上，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0121c11\">0121c11</span><p class=\"lg\">眾聖及二乘，<caesura/>皆趣於斯道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0121c12\">0121c12</span><p class=\"lg\">一切諸菩薩，<caesura/>發趣大菩提，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0121c13\">0121c13</span><p class=\"lg\">為得道莊嚴，<caesura/>以斯道開示。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0121c14\">0121c14</span><p class=\"lg\">若於斯道中，<caesura/>已趣今趣者，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0121c15\">0121c15</span><p class=\"lg\">彼皆以正見，<caesura/>安住於斯道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0121c16\">0121c16</span><p class=\"lg\">一切諸菩薩，<caesura/>若住平等見，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0121c17\">0121c17</span><p class=\"lg\">行於斯道中，<caesura/>安樂而發趣。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0121c18\">0121c18</span><p class=\"lg\">斯道最殊勝，<caesura/>斯道為無上，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0121c19\">0121c19</span><p class=\"lg\">如實能誘進，<caesura/>於中無所執。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0121c20\">0121c20</span><p class=\"lg\">若住於斯道，<caesura/>行於斯道中，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0121c21\">0121c21</span><p class=\"lg\">一切諸智人，<caesura/>其意不傾動。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0121c22\">0121c22</span><p class=\"lg\">不說於斯道，<caesura/>少有傾動者，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0121c23\">0121c23</span><p class=\"lg\">由是無所動，<caesura/>於動常遠離。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0121c24\">0121c24</span><p class=\"lg\">我說於斯道，<caesura/>無動無施為，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0121c25\">0121c25</span><p class=\"lg\">亦無有增益，<caesura/>斯道故無上。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0121c26\">0121c26</span><p class=\"lg\">一切諸菩薩，<caesura/>善住於斯道，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0121c27\">0121c27</span><p class=\"lg\">斯道無有愛，<caesura/>亦復無有憎。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0121c28\">0121c28</span><p class=\"lg\">斯道非過去，<caesura/>斯道非未來，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0121c29\">0121c29</span><p class=\"lg\">彼際不分別，<caesura/>如是而修習。</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0122a01\">0122a01</span><p class=\"lg\">斯道無煩惱，<caesura/>斯道無分別，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0122a02\">0122a02</span><p class=\"lg\">於義不乖違，<caesura/>如是而安住。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0122a03\">0122a03</span><p class=\"lg\">住於最勝道，<caesura/>無住為安住，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0122a04\">0122a04</span><p class=\"lg\">住於斯道者，<caesura/>能獲清淨性。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0122a05\">0122a05</span><p class=\"lg\">我說八支道，<caesura/>眾聖之所行，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0122a06\">0122a06</span><p class=\"lg\">住於斯道者，<caesura/>菩提不難得。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0122a07\">0122a07</span><p class=\"lg\">菩薩依怙者，<caesura/>如是住斯道，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0122a08\">0122a08</span><p class=\"lg\">能得道清淨，<caesura/>一一而進趣。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0122a09\">0122a09</span><p class=\"lg\">斯之最上道，<caesura/>善士所修行，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0122a10\">0122a10</span><p class=\"lg\">如來所稱讚，<caesura/>此智為無上。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0122a11\">0122a11</span><p class=\"lg\">魔及魔軍眾，<caesura/>魔之所攝者，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0122a12\">0122a12</span><p class=\"lg\">外道餘眾生，<caesura/>非其所行處。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0122a13\">0122a13</span><p class=\"lg\">分別涅槃者，<caesura/>不住斯勝道，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0122a14\">0122a14</span><p class=\"lg\">愚為分別害，<caesura/>不能趣涅槃。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0122a15\">0122a15</span><p class=\"lg\">超過分別者，<caesura/>無想無分別，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0122a16\">0122a16</span><p class=\"lg\">於斯大道中，<caesura/>以是而發趣。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0122a17\">0122a17</span><p class=\"lg\">眾聖之勝道，<caesura/>愚夫皆遠離，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0122a18\">0122a18</span><p class=\"lg\">若行此法者，<caesura/>斯道為無上。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0122a19\">0122a19</span><p class=\"lg\">斯之最勝道，<caesura/>能至無上處，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0122a20\">0122a20</span><p class=\"lg\">其中無衰惱，<caesura/>無畏無災難。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0122a21\">0122a21</span><p class=\"lg\">斯之無上道，<caesura/>無色無形相，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0122a22\">0122a22</span><p class=\"lg\">不可以色相，<caesura/>而能示現者。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0122a23\">0122a23</span><p class=\"lg\">斯之安隱道，<caesura/>正直無所畏，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0122a24\">0122a24</span><p class=\"lg\">以斯道發趣，<caesura/>究竟大涅槃。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0122a25\">0122a25</span><p class=\"lg\">斯之最淨道，<caesura/>猶若太虛空，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0122a26\">0122a26</span><p class=\"lg\">一切無罣礙，<caesura/>常趣於涅槃。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0122a27\">0122a27</span><p class=\"lg\">若至涅槃者，<caesura/>一往無復退，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0122a28\">0122a28</span><p class=\"lg\">斯之大涅槃，<caesura/>最上勝安樂。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0122a29\">0122a29</span><p class=\"lg\">涅槃大宮殿，<caesura/>空寂不可量，</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0122b01\">0122b01</span><p class=\"lg\">故名大涅槃，<caesura/>亦名大宮殿。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0122b02\">0122b02</span><p class=\"lg\">斯大涅槃中，<caesura/>三毒煩惱滅，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0122b03\">0122b03</span><p class=\"lg\">若至其中者，<caesura/>無退無受生。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0122b04\">0122b04</span><p class=\"lg\">涅槃大空寂，<caesura/>猶若太虛空，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0122b05\">0122b05</span><p class=\"lg\">廣大空寂故，<caesura/>於中無罣礙。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0122b06\">0122b06</span><p class=\"lg\">涅槃大宮殿，<caesura/>永離苦憂惱，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0122b07\">0122b07</span><p class=\"lg\">無邊境界處，<caesura/>說名為涅槃。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0122b08\">0122b08</span><p class=\"lg\">涅槃無數量，<caesura/>數量不可得，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0122b09\">0122b09</span><p class=\"lg\">寂滅清涼性，<caesura/><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0122b0901\">說【CB】【麗-CB】，設【大】</span><app n=\"0122b0901\"><p class=\"lg\">說<note type=\"cf1\">K06n0022_p0172b06</note></lem><rdg wit=\"【大】\">設</rdg></app>名為涅槃。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0122b10\">0122b10</span><p class=\"lg\">涅槃無施設，<caesura/>趣道亦無上，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0122b11\">0122b11</span><p class=\"lg\">無量無分別，<caesura/>分別不可得。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0122b12\">0122b12</span><p class=\"lg\">我為諸菩薩，<caesura/>開示於斯道，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0122b13\">0122b13</span><p class=\"lg\">若住斯道者，<caesura/>彼近於涅槃。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0122b14\">0122b14</span><p class=\"lg\">若住於斯道，<caesura/>世間勝安樂，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0122b15\">0122b15</span><p class=\"lg\">一切皆當得，<caesura/>說名無畏者。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0122b16\">0122b16</span><p class=\"lg\">善住於斯道，<caesura/>其心無所染，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0122b17\">0122b17</span><p class=\"lg\">由是道清淨，<caesura/>說名無畏者。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0122b18\">0122b18</span><p class=\"lg\">以見平正道，<caesura/>一切能隨覺，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0122b19\">0122b19</span><p class=\"lg\">一切資具中，<caesura/>一切不貪著。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0122b20\">0122b20</span><p class=\"lg\">菩薩依怙者，<caesura/>殊勝真實道，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0122b21\">0122b21</span><p class=\"lg\">饒益諸眾生，<caesura/>勇猛而發趣。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0122b22\">0122b22</span><p class=\"lg\">若得無上道，<caesura/>最上道莊嚴，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0122b23\">0122b23</span><p class=\"lg\">令世悉歡喜，<caesura/>斯道而發趣。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0122b24\">0122b24</span><p class=\"lg\">斯道最殊勝，<caesura/>能令意清淨，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0122b25\">0122b25</span><p class=\"lg\">隨其所樂求，<caesura/>一切當發趣。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0122b26\">0122b26</span><p class=\"lg\">若得聖王位，<caesura/>轉輪大軍旅，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0122b27\">0122b27</span><p class=\"lg\">能捨大王位，<caesura/>出家行學道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0122b28\">0122b28</span><p class=\"lg\">若得天帝釋，<caesura/>大梵天王位，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0122b29\">0122b29</span><p class=\"lg\">於彼無耽著，<caesura/>斯為善順<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0122001\">道＝者【三】【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0122001\">道【大】，者【宋】【元】【明】【宮】</span><app n=\"0122001\"><p class=\"lg\">道</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】 【宮】\">者</rdg></app>。</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0122c01\">0122c01</span><p class=\"lg\">世間諸學處，<caesura/>一切能明了，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0122c02\">0122c02</span><p class=\"lg\">住於斯道中，<caesura/>乃為實語者。</p></lg>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0122c03\">0122c03</span><p>「復次無邊慧！諸菩薩摩訶薩於此道中而發\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0122c04\">0122c04</span>趣時！為欲攝取八正道故修行一法，所謂不\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0122c05\">0122c05</span>作諸不善法。又為攝取八正道故修行二法：\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0122c06\">0122c06</span>一者於內隨何善法如理思惟，二者於外隨\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0122c07\">0122c07</span>何善法如理請問。又為攝取八正道故修行二\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0122c08\">0122c08</span>法：一者如事了知諸法，二者了知無事無住\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0122c09\">0122c09</span>無所分別。又為攝取八正道故修行二法：一\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0122c10\">0122c10</span>者於內隨順覺知，二者於外無所執著。又為\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0122c11\">0122c11</span>攝取八正道故修行二法：一者自信無所分\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0122c12\">0122c12</span>別；二者眾生若未有信，我令安住於此道中。\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0122c13\">0122c13</span>又為攝取八正道故修行二法：一者能於所\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0122c14\">0122c14</span>作之業如實知見，二者能於所作之業而無\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0122c15\">0122c15</span>執著。又為攝取八正道故修行三法：一者於\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0122c16\">0122c16</span>諸苦取蘊中一一了知，二者於諸無苦取蘊\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0122c17\">0122c17</span>勤求至樂，三者於諸和合法中專修遠離。又\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0122c18\">0122c18</span>為攝取八正道故修行三法：一者宣說最上\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0122c19\">0122c19</span>之法語不乖違，隨說法義心無諍論；二者不\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0122c20\">0122c20</span>著一切文字；三者攝取一切諸法。又為攝取\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0122c21\">0122c21</span>八正道故修行四法：一者於義正方便事，二\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0122c22\">0122c22</span>者隨義而作相應正方便事，三者順法而作\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0122c23\">0122c23</span>觀察正方便事，四者不起一切執著正方便\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0122c24\">0122c24</span>事。又為攝取八正道故修行四法：一者能以\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0122c25\">0122c25</span>堅誓自守如說而行，二者能以六根善巧於\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0122c26\">0122c26</span>道發趣，三者能令意樂清淨，四者能住不放\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0122c27\">0122c27</span>逸行。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0122c28\">0122c28</span><p>「無邊慧！諸菩薩摩訶薩以此法行攝取道故，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0122c29\">0122c29</span>乃可名為隨順道者，觀一切法性空故、無名\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0123a01\">0123a01</span>故、無相故、無願故、無生故、無作故、厭故、離\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0123a02\">0123a02</span>故、滅故、出故，得法光明。觀生盡時，不於無生\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0123a03\">0123a03</span>而起生想，便於爾時超昇離生、出過非法，得\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0123a04\">0123a04</span>道清淨、獲無生忍。道清淨故過一切想，不住\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0123a05\">0123a05</span>非想滅於道想，離於法想出無明網，以明修\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0123a06\">0123a06</span>習所應得法悉能得之。明所修習得何等法？\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0123a07\">0123a07</span>謂明修習得想受滅，得一切法決定善巧，得\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0123a08\">0123a08</span>隨祕密順於法性。諸菩薩摩訶薩行此道時，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0123a09\">0123a09</span>不住於處不為相覆，知一切法同於虛空，生\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0123a10\">0123a10</span>如空生、性如空性，無有少相而為罣礙。此道\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0123a11\">0123a11</span>清淨不畏災患，被大甲冑不為執縛，乘於大\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0123a12\">0123a12</span>乘無所迷惑，離諸障難猶如虛空。於此道中\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0123a13\">0123a13</span>而發趣之，為諸眾生作大光明。無邊慧！是為\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0123a14\">0123a14</span>諸菩薩摩訶薩殊勝之道，非諸聲聞緣覺所\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0123a15\">0123a15</span>行。」</p><p>爾時世尊而說偈言：</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0123a16\">0123a16</span><p class=\"lg\"><p class=\"lg\">「為攝八正道，<caesura/>演說諸法行，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0123a17\">0123a17</span><p class=\"lg\">若住此道中，<caesura/>斯為大精進。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0123a18\">0123a18</span><p class=\"lg\">善法修行者，<caesura/>能於一切時，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0123a19\">0123a19</span><p class=\"lg\">不作不善法，<caesura/>斯行攝於道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0123a20\">0123a20</span><p class=\"lg\">菩薩修習者，<caesura/>於內如理思，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0123a21\">0123a21</span><p class=\"lg\">於外求請問，<caesura/>斯行攝於道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0123a22\">0123a22</span><p class=\"lg\">菩薩觀察者，<caesura/>如事正了知，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0123a23\">0123a23</span><p class=\"lg\">如理如法住，<caesura/>斯行攝於道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0123a24\">0123a24</span><p class=\"lg\">菩薩依怙者，<caesura/>於內隨覺知，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0123a25\">0123a25</span><p class=\"lg\">於外無所執，<caesura/>斯行攝於道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0123a26\">0123a26</span><p class=\"lg\">菩薩無畏者，<caesura/>自信無分別，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0123a27\">0123a27</span><p class=\"lg\">令他住淨信，<caesura/>斯行攝於道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0123a28\">0123a28</span><p class=\"lg\">菩薩思惟者，<caesura/>淨諸所作業，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0123a29\">0123a29</span><p class=\"lg\">於業無所執，<caesura/>斯行攝於道。</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0123b01\">0123b01</span><p class=\"lg\">菩薩無繫者，<caesura/>常知苦取蘊，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0123b02\">0123b02</span><p class=\"lg\">求無苦取蘊，<caesura/>斯行攝於道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0123b03\">0123b03</span><p class=\"lg\">菩薩善智者，<caesura/>修離和合行，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0123b04\">0123b04</span><p class=\"lg\">能離於和合，<caesura/>斯行攝於道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0123b05\">0123b05</span><p class=\"lg\">菩薩思<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0123001\">義＝議【三】【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0123001\">義【大】，議【宋】【元】【明】【宮】</span><app n=\"0123001\"><p class=\"lg\">義</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】 【宮】\">議</rdg></app>者，<caesura/>隨義能了知，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0123b06\">0123b06</span><p class=\"lg\">演說無違諍，<caesura/>斯行攝於道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0123b07\">0123b07</span><p class=\"lg\">菩薩具慧者，<caesura/>不著於文字，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0123b08\">0123b08</span><p class=\"lg\">攝持一切法，<caesura/>斯行攝於道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0123b09\">0123b09</span><p class=\"lg\">菩薩行法者，<caesura/>能與法相應，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0123b10\">0123b10</span><p class=\"lg\">亦隨義相應，<caesura/>斯行攝於道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0123b11\">0123b11</span><p class=\"lg\">菩薩順道者，<caesura/>正住於堅誓，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0123b12\">0123b12</span><p class=\"lg\">如說而修行，<caesura/>斯行攝於道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0123b13\">0123b13</span><p class=\"lg\">菩薩道清淨，<caesura/>善淨於意樂，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0123b14\">0123b14</span><p class=\"lg\">住法不放逸，<caesura/>斯行攝於道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0123b15\">0123b15</span><p class=\"lg\">菩薩一切時，<caesura/>勤修此諸行，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0123b16\">0123b16</span><p class=\"lg\">身心獲安樂，<caesura/>斯行攝於道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0123b17\">0123b17</span><p class=\"lg\">菩薩正念者，<caesura/>住於清淨道，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0123b18\">0123b18</span><p class=\"lg\">了知一切法，<caesura/>皆空無有相。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0123b19\">0123b19</span><p class=\"lg\">菩薩觀察者，<caesura/>能令願清淨，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0123b20\">0123b20</span><p class=\"lg\">亦不住無願，<caesura/>遠離於諸相。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0123b21\">0123b21</span><p class=\"lg\">菩薩如理觀，<caesura/>理趣悉平等，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0123b22\">0123b22</span><p class=\"lg\">於諸法不生，<caesura/>無有少疑惑。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0123b23\">0123b23</span><p class=\"lg\">菩薩妙智者，<caesura/>能觀一切法，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0123b24\">0123b24</span><p class=\"lg\">厭離寂滅故，<caesura/>明見而發趣。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0123b25\">0123b25</span><p class=\"lg\">菩薩觀法者，<caesura/>如理見法生，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0123b26\">0123b26</span><p class=\"lg\">不於生見生，<caesura/>不於盡見盡。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0123b27\">0123b27</span><p class=\"lg\">菩薩精進者，<caesura/>如是觀察時，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0123b28\">0123b28</span><p class=\"lg\">出離於非法，<caesura/>超昇正位中。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0123b29\">0123b29</span><p class=\"lg\">菩薩妙智者，<caesura/>斯道為清淨，</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0123c01\">0123c01</span><p class=\"lg\">速至大安隱，<caesura/>成就無上忍。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0123c02\">0123c02</span><p class=\"lg\">菩薩妙智者，<caesura/>隨順觀諸法，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0123c03\">0123c03</span><p class=\"lg\">超過一切想，<caesura/>常住於無想。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0123c04\">0123c04</span><p class=\"lg\">菩薩妙智者，<caesura/>斯道能淨治，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0123c05\">0123c05</span><p class=\"lg\">遠離於道想，<caesura/>亦不住法想。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0123c06\">0123c06</span><p class=\"lg\">菩薩妙智者，<caesura/>斯道淨治故，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0123c07\">0123c07</span><p class=\"lg\">出於無明網，<caesura/>獲大法光明。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0123c08\">0123c08</span><p class=\"lg\">菩薩妙智者，<caesura/>能<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0123002\">以＝於【元】【明】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0123002\">以【大】，於【元】【明】</span><app n=\"0123002\"><p class=\"lg\">以</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【元】 【明】\">於</rdg></app>明修習，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0123c09\">0123c09</span><p class=\"lg\">教授諸眾生，<caesura/>由是而發趣。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0123c10\">0123c10</span><p class=\"lg\">菩薩明修習，<caesura/>為得一切法，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0123c11\">0123c11</span><p class=\"lg\">決定甚深義，<caesura/>善巧大方便。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0123c12\">0123c12</span><p class=\"lg\">菩薩明修習，<caesura/>方便離諸想，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0123c13\">0123c13</span><p class=\"lg\">隨順祕密法，<caesura/>能知決定義。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0123c14\">0123c14</span><p class=\"lg\">菩薩妙智者，<caesura/>以大法光明，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0123c15\">0123c15</span><p class=\"lg\">能滅於想受，<caesura/>由是而發趣。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0123c16\">0123c16</span><p class=\"lg\">菩薩妙智者，<caesura/>不住於斯道，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0123c17\">0123c17</span><p class=\"lg\">不住斯道故，<caesura/>於道而發趣。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0123c18\">0123c18</span><p class=\"lg\">菩薩無畏者，<caesura/>能知一切法，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0123c19\">0123c19</span><p class=\"lg\">猶若淨虛空，<caesura/>諸相無所覆。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0123c20\">0123c20</span><p class=\"lg\">菩薩知諸法，<caesura/>其性同虛空，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0123c21\">0123c21</span><p class=\"lg\">諸法如空故，<caesura/>清淨而無垢。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0123c22\">0123c22</span><p class=\"lg\">菩薩如是住，<caesura/>不為相所礙，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0123c23\">0123c23</span><p class=\"lg\">速為諸眾生，<caesura/>演說而教授。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0123c24\">0123c24</span><p class=\"lg\">菩薩妙智者，<caesura/>一切道清淨，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0123c25\">0123c25</span><p class=\"lg\">於道無災患，<caesura/>無礙而發趣。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0123c26\">0123c26</span><p class=\"lg\">如是清淨道，<caesura/>速往大菩提，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0123c27\">0123c27</span><p class=\"lg\">能於無為證，<caesura/>平等而發趣。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0123c28\">0123c28</span><p class=\"lg\">菩薩大甲冑，<caesura/>大乘及大道，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0123c29\">0123c29</span><p class=\"lg\">如空無罣礙，<caesura/>清淨而發趣。</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0124a01\">0124a01</span><p class=\"lg\">趣斯乘及道，<caesura/>如趣太虛空，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0124a02\">0124a02</span><p class=\"lg\">遠離於眾相，<caesura/>無相而發趣。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0124a03\">0124a03</span><p class=\"lg\">大乘平等乘，<caesura/>廣大如虛空，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0124a04\">0124a04</span><p class=\"lg\">於斯清淨道，<caesura/>此乘當發趣。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0124a05\">0124a05</span><p class=\"lg\">一切諸菩薩，<caesura/>尊重於斯法，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0124a06\">0124a06</span><p class=\"lg\">為諸眾生故，<caesura/>勇猛而發趣。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0124a07\">0124a07</span><p class=\"lg\">若詣大菩提，<caesura/>住斯殊勝道，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0124a08\">0124a08</span><p class=\"lg\">非諸二乘等，<caesura/>於<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0124001\">此＝斯【三】【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0124001\">此【大】，斯【宋】【元】【明】【宮】</span><app n=\"0124001\"><p class=\"lg\">此</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】 【宮】\">斯</rdg></app>能發趣。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0124a09\">0124a09</span><p class=\"lg\">菩薩正憶念，<caesura/>能令道清淨，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0124a10\">0124a10</span><p class=\"lg\">以斯清淨道，<caesura/>最上而發趣。</p></lg>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0124a11\">0124a11</span><p>「復次無邊慧！諸菩薩摩訶薩如是發趣之時，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0124a12\">0124a12</span>能以善巧而正了知無量念處、正斷、根、力、覺\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0124a13\">0124a13</span>分、解脫、等持等至、神足止觀，無量功德殊勝\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0124a14\">0124a14</span>莊嚴，為欲降伏諸世間故被大甲冑，出三界\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0124a15\">0124a15</span>故乘於大乘，攝受天人阿修羅故安住斯道，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0124a16\">0124a16</span>而發趣於阿耨多羅三藐三菩提。無邊慧！諸\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0124a17\">0124a17</span>菩薩摩訶薩被大甲冑乘於大乘住斯道時，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0124a18\">0124a18</span>不以慈悲喜捨遍照眾生，於諸眾生不愛如\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0124a19\">0124a19</span>己。如是甲冑大乘大道，而於大地所不堪受，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0124a20\">0124a20</span>一切眾生不任親近。若以哀愍利益眾生被\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0124a21\">0124a21</span>大甲冑乘於大乘安住斯道，如是甲冑大乘\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0124a22\">0124a22</span>大道，一切世間天人阿修羅所不能行，一切\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0124a23\">0124a23</span>愚夫耽著世間住世間者亦不能見。又諸菩\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0124a24\">0124a24</span>薩摩訶薩哀愍一切諸眾生故被大甲冑，能\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0124a25\">0124a25</span>以甲冑加持地界水火風界，令此地界而不\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0124a26\">0124a26</span>傾覆，一切眾生不生恐怖，能令水界火界風\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0124a27\">0124a27</span>界隨彼所應作所應作。又諸菩薩摩訶薩始\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0124a28\">0124a28</span>自初心發趣甲冑，乃至今被斯大甲冑乘此\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0124a29\">0124a29</span>大乘，以清淨道而發趣於一生補處，詣菩提\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0124b01\">0124b01</span>樹坐道場時。此三千大千世界之中，金剛所\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0124b02\">0124b02</span>成堅固場地，若不加持<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0124002\">踊＝涌【宋】【明】【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0124002\">踊【大】，涌【宋】【明】【宮】</span><app n=\"0124002\"><p class=\"lg\">踊</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【明】 【宮】\">涌</rdg></app>沒傾覆。雖以堅固\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0124b03\">0124b03</span>金剛所成，無堪荷負斯大甲冑大乘大道。又\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0124b04\">0124b04</span>諸菩薩摩訶薩往昔誓願，於諸眾生<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0124003\">趣＝起【明】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0124003\">趣【大】，起【明】</span><app n=\"0124003\"><p class=\"lg\">趣</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【明】\">起</rdg></app>慈悲\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0124b05\">0124b05</span>故，十方諸佛諸大菩薩共稱讚故，設復金剛\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0124b06\">0124b06</span>大輪圍山、須彌盧山、一切寶山及餘山王，若\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0124b07\">0124b07</span>不加持亦無堪荷斯大甲冑大乘大道。又諸\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0124b08\">0124b08</span>菩薩摩訶薩本願力故、諸佛如來本願力故，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0124b09\">0124b09</span>於諸眾生不為惱故、不為害故、不為損故、不\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0124b10\">0124b10</span>為怨故、不為讐故、不<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0124004\">凌＝陵【明】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0124004\">凌【大】，陵【明】</span><app n=\"0124004\"><p class=\"lg\">凌</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【明】\">陵</rdg></app>恃故、不逼迫故，為\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0124b11\">0124b11</span>令眾生獲安樂故，被大甲冑乘於大乘住斯\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0124b12\">0124b12</span>道中，而發趣於阿耨多羅三藐三菩提。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0124b13\">0124b13</span><p>「無邊慧！諸菩薩摩訶薩被甲冑時，被慧甲冑、\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0124b14\">0124b14</span>持慧刀仗、大慧迴向，乘迴向乘、<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0124005\">起＝趣【明】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0124005\">起【大】，趣【明】</span><app n=\"0124005\"><p class=\"lg\">起</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【明】\">趣</rdg></app>慧光明、住\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0124b15\">0124b15</span>光明道，以慧明眼觀察諸法，而發<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0124006\">起＝趣【元】【明】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0124006\">起【大】，趣【元】【明】</span><app n=\"0124006\"><p class=\"lg\">起</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【元】 【明】\">趣</rdg></app>於一切\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0124b16\">0124b16</span>智智。為欲攝取一切智智，為諸眾生修行般\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0124b17\">0124b17</span>若波羅蜜、檀那波羅蜜、尸羅波羅蜜、羼提波\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0124b18\">0124b18</span>羅蜜、毘梨耶波羅蜜、禪波羅蜜，一切皆以慧\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0124b19\">0124b19</span>為先導、慧為修習、慧為攝持，迴向阿耨多羅\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0124b20\">0124b20</span>三藐三菩提。」</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0124b21\">0124b21</span><p>爾時無邊慧菩薩摩訶薩白佛言：「希有世尊！\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0124b22\">0124b22</span>諸菩薩摩訶薩若干智慧，遍一切處悉能攝\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0124b23\">0124b23</span>持，成就無量諸佛之法。」</p><p>爾時世尊告無邊慧\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0124b24\">0124b24</span>菩薩摩訶薩言：「無邊慧！如是如是，如汝所說。\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0124b25\">0124b25</span>諸菩薩摩訶薩若干智慧，遍一切處攝一切\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0124b26\">0124b26</span>法，被大甲冑乘於大乘住斯大道，一一皆以\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0124b27\">0124b27</span>慧為先導而發趣之。無邊慧！設有智慧無慧\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0124b28\">0124b28</span>先導，於此道中不能發趣。若有智慧以慧先\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0124b29\">0124b29</span>導，遍一切處隨轉隨行，以慧攝持、以慧防禦，\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0124c01\">0124c01</span>爾時乃名被大甲冑乘於大乘住斯大道，以\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0124c02\">0124c02</span>安隱法饒益世間，能開慧眼以眼觀察，慧身\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0124c03\">0124c03</span>朗照放大光明，而發趣於阿耨多羅三藐三\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0124c04\">0124c04</span>菩提。無邊慧！是為諸菩薩摩訶薩所被甲冑\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0124c05\">0124c05</span>甲冑莊嚴、所乘大乘大乘莊嚴、所行大道大\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0124c06\">0124c06</span>道莊嚴，而發趣於阿耨多羅三藐三菩提。無\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0124c07\">0124c07</span>邊慧！諸善丈夫甲冑莊嚴、大乘莊嚴、大道莊\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0124c08\">0124c08</span>嚴，一切功德種種莊嚴，我若具說，於無量劫\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0124c09\">0124c09</span>不可窮盡。為令汝等而了知故，亦為未來諸\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0124c10\">0124c10</span>善丈夫甲冑莊嚴、大乘莊嚴、大道莊嚴，無邊\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0124c11\">0124c11</span>功德資糧莊嚴，我今於此略說少分。彼善丈\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0124c12\">0124c12</span>夫若聞我法，亦當被大甲冑乘於大乘住斯\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0124c13\">0124c13</span>大道，功德莊嚴而發趣之。」</p><p>爾時世尊而說偈\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0124c14\">0124c14</span>言：</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0124c15\">0124c15</span><p class=\"lg\"><p class=\"lg\">「我說一切斷，<caesura/>亦說四念住，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0124c16\">0124c16</span><p class=\"lg\">一切善方便，<caesura/>斯由不放逸。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0124c17\">0124c17</span><p class=\"lg\">具足正憶念，<caesura/>法善巧相應，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0124c18\">0124c18</span><p class=\"lg\">勇進而出離，<caesura/>斯由不放逸。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0124c19\">0124c19</span><p class=\"lg\">根力菩提分，<caesura/>被甲乘大乘，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0124c20\">0124c20</span><p class=\"lg\">以此為侍衛，<caesura/>菩薩當發趣。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0124c21\">0124c21</span><p class=\"lg\">禪定勝解脫，<caesura/>等持及等至，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0124c22\">0124c22</span><p class=\"lg\">以此為侍衛，<caesura/>菩薩當發趣。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0124c23\">0124c23</span><p class=\"lg\">大慈悲喜捨，<caesura/>被甲乘大乘，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0124c24\">0124c24</span><p class=\"lg\">以此為侍衛，<caesura/>菩薩當發趣。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0124c25\">0124c25</span><p class=\"lg\">成就於止觀，<caesura/>神足及神變，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0124c26\">0124c26</span><p class=\"lg\">以此為侍衛，<caesura/>菩薩當發趣。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0124c27\">0124c27</span><p class=\"lg\">無量諸功德，<caesura/>被甲乘大乘，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0124c28\">0124c28</span><p class=\"lg\">於道無疲倦，<caesura/>菩薩當發趣。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0124c29\">0124c29</span><p class=\"lg\">精進不放逸，<caesura/>被甲乘大乘，</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0125a01\">0125a01</span><p class=\"lg\">了知彼念處，<caesura/>菩薩當發趣。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0125a02\">0125a02</span><p class=\"lg\">光明大甲冑，<caesura/>降伏諸世間，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0125a03\">0125a03</span><p class=\"lg\">被斯甲冑已，<caesura/>乃名為智者。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0125a04\">0125a04</span><p class=\"lg\">正趣一切智，<caesura/>出過三界中，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0125a05\">0125a05</span><p class=\"lg\">乘斯大乘已，<caesura/>乃名為智者。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0125a06\">0125a06</span><p class=\"lg\">大道清淨道，<caesura/>映蔽諸世間，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0125a07\">0125a07</span><p class=\"lg\">天人阿修羅，<caesura/>乃名遍聞者。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0125a08\">0125a08</span><p class=\"lg\">如是諸菩薩，<caesura/>普為諸眾生，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0125a09\">0125a09</span><p class=\"lg\">能於一切時，<caesura/>精進被甲冑。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0125a10\">0125a10</span><p class=\"lg\">菩薩不修習，<caesura/>大慈及大悲，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0125a11\">0125a11</span><p class=\"lg\">大喜大捨等，<caesura/>大地不堪受。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0125a12\">0125a12</span><p class=\"lg\">菩薩不修習，<caesura/>於彼諸眾生，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0125a13\">0125a13</span><p class=\"lg\">知時饒益事，<caesura/>大地不堪受。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0125a14\">0125a14</span><p class=\"lg\">菩薩不修習，<caesura/>於彼諸眾生，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0125a15\">0125a15</span><p class=\"lg\">愛之如己者，<caesura/>大地不堪受。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0125a16\">0125a16</span><p class=\"lg\">菩薩不修習，<caesura/>以慈乘大乘，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0125a17\">0125a17</span><p class=\"lg\">諸山及大海，<caesura/>大地不堪受。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0125a18\">0125a18</span><p class=\"lg\">菩薩不修習，<caesura/>慈念諸眾生，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0125a19\">0125a19</span><p class=\"lg\">乘於此大乘，<caesura/>眾生不親近。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0125a20\">0125a20</span><p class=\"lg\">若被斯甲冑，<caesura/>慈光不照明，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0125a21\">0125a21</span><p class=\"lg\">於彼大甲冑，<caesura/>眾生不親近。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0125a22\">0125a22</span><p class=\"lg\">若被斯甲冑，<caesura/>功德海無邊，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0125a23\">0125a23</span><p class=\"lg\">加持四大界，<caesura/>彼乃堪荷負。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0125a24\">0125a24</span><p class=\"lg\">攝取眾生故，<caesura/>普照以慈光，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0125a25\">0125a25</span><p class=\"lg\">加持四大界，<caesura/>彼乃堪荷負。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0125a26\">0125a26</span><p class=\"lg\">攝取眾生故，<caesura/>成就大菩提，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0125a27\">0125a27</span><p class=\"lg\">加持四大界，<caesura/>彼乃堪荷負。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0125a28\">0125a28</span><p class=\"lg\">不譏惱眾生，<caesura/>被斯大甲冑，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0125a29\">0125a29</span><p class=\"lg\">大乘而出離，<caesura/>斯名為智者。</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0125b01\">0125b01</span><p class=\"lg\">善巧大方便，<caesura/>一切悉加持，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0125b02\">0125b02</span><p class=\"lg\">無上而出離，<caesura/>斯名為智者。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0125b03\">0125b03</span><p class=\"lg\">由是此大地，<caesura/>不沒亦不傾，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0125b04\">0125b04</span><p class=\"lg\">水火風界等，<caesura/>能作所應作。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0125b05\">0125b05</span><p class=\"lg\">然諸大菩薩，<caesura/>被甲乃無邊，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0125b06\">0125b06</span><p class=\"lg\">乘於此大乘，<caesura/>以道而發趣。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0125b07\">0125b07</span><p class=\"lg\">成就一生處，<caesura/>至於最後身，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0125b08\">0125b08</span><p class=\"lg\">往詣樹王下，<caesura/>坐于堅固地。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0125b09\">0125b09</span><p class=\"lg\">於此道場處，<caesura/>安住如金剛，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0125b10\">0125b10</span><p class=\"lg\">身心不疲倦，<caesura/>現證一切智。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0125b11\">0125b11</span><p class=\"lg\">菩薩無畏者，<caesura/>若不以加持，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0125b12\">0125b12</span><p class=\"lg\">彼地當傾覆，<caesura/>壞已無復成。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0125b13\">0125b13</span><p class=\"lg\">一切大地界，<caesura/>若不以加持，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0125b14\">0125b14</span><p class=\"lg\">假使金剛<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0125001\">成＝剎【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0125001\">成【大】，剎【宮】</span><app n=\"0125001\"><p class=\"lg\">成</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宮】\">剎</rdg></app>，<caesura/>無不傾覆者。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0125b15\">0125b15</span><p class=\"lg\">菩薩於往昔，<caesura/>大誓願莊嚴，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0125b16\">0125b16</span><p class=\"lg\">於諸眾生所，<caesura/>已起大慈念。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0125b17\">0125b17</span><p class=\"lg\">現在十方界，<caesura/>諸佛剎土中，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0125b18\">0125b18</span><p class=\"lg\">遍知兩足尊，<caesura/>一切皆護念。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0125b19\">0125b19</span><p class=\"lg\">設復餘石山，<caesura/>須彌盧寶山，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0125b20\">0125b20</span><p class=\"lg\">金剛輪圍山，<caesura/>堅固嶷然住。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0125b21\">0125b21</span><p class=\"lg\">菩薩智慧者，<caesura/>若不以加持，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0125b22\">0125b22</span><p class=\"lg\">於斯大甲冑，<caesura/>不堪為荷負。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0125b23\">0125b23</span><p class=\"lg\">諸佛諸菩薩，<caesura/>神力所加持，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0125b24\">0125b24</span><p class=\"lg\">眾生及大地，<caesura/>堪近堪荷負。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0125b25\">0125b25</span><p class=\"lg\">被斯大甲冑，<caesura/>不為惱眾生，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0125b26\">0125b26</span><p class=\"lg\">甲冑無有上，<caesura/>以乘當發趣。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0125b27\">0125b27</span><p class=\"lg\">被斯大甲冑，<caesura/>不為害眾生，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0125b28\">0125b28</span><p class=\"lg\">甲冑不思議，<caesura/>以乘當發趣。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0125b29\">0125b29</span><p class=\"lg\">被斯大甲冑，<caesura/>不為讎眾生，</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0125c01\">0125c01</span><p class=\"lg\">為除眾生病，<caesura/>以乘當發趣。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0125c02\">0125c02</span><p class=\"lg\">具足殊勝道，<caesura/>無上最淨治，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0125c03\">0125c03</span><p class=\"lg\">不惱不讎怨，<caesura/>不害正安住。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0125c04\">0125c04</span><p class=\"lg\">被慧大甲冑，<caesura/>乘慧迴向乘，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0125c05\">0125c05</span><p class=\"lg\">甲冑不可壞，<caesura/>迴向無過上。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0125c06\">0125c06</span><p class=\"lg\">菩薩依怙者，<caesura/>住道慧光明，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0125c07\">0125c07</span><p class=\"lg\">以慧觀諸法，<caesura/>無上而發趣。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0125c08\">0125c08</span><p class=\"lg\">菩薩殊勝道，<caesura/>甲冑及大乘，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0125c09\">0125c09</span><p class=\"lg\">斯由慧光起，<caesura/>是故心清淨。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0125c10\">0125c10</span><p class=\"lg\">乘諸波羅蜜，<caesura/>趣佛大菩提，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0125c11\">0125c11</span><p class=\"lg\">慧攝慧清淨，<caesura/>以慧為先導。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0125c12\">0125c12</span><p class=\"lg\">一切波羅蜜，<caesura/>以此慧為先，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0125c13\">0125c13</span><p class=\"lg\">慧攝慧清淨，<caesura/>能授無上智。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0125c14\">0125c14</span><p class=\"lg\">菩薩不思議，<caesura/>能起慧光明，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0125c15\">0125c15</span><p class=\"lg\">能然大慧燈，<caesura/>安樂而發趣。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0125c16\">0125c16</span><p class=\"lg\">起慧光明故，<caesura/>慧眼由是開，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0125c17\">0125c17</span><p class=\"lg\">於佛無上智，<caesura/>明見而發趣。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0125c18\">0125c18</span><p class=\"lg\">菩薩勇猛者，<caesura/>甲冑乃無邊，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0125c19\">0125c19</span><p class=\"lg\">無邊莊嚴故，<caesura/>名為大甲冑。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0125c20\">0125c20</span><p class=\"lg\">菩薩大智者，<caesura/>大乘大莊嚴，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0125c21\">0125c21</span><p class=\"lg\">於佛一切智，<caesura/>無染而發趣。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0125c22\">0125c22</span><p class=\"lg\">菩薩大智者，<caesura/>大道大莊嚴，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0125c23\">0125c23</span><p class=\"lg\">殊勝不思議，<caesura/>清淨而發趣。</p></lg>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0125c24\">0125c24</span><cb:juan n=\"022\" fun=\"close\"><cb:jhead><title>大寶積經</title>卷第二十二</cb:jhead></cb:juan>\r\n</cb:div></body>"
    }
  ],
  "version": "CBReader 2X v0.9.9 2026-01-21"
}